From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Seabraid <seabraid@example.invalid>
Date: Sat, 1 Jan 2000 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 13/16] D4 (opt-in STRATA_PREFILL_REMOTE_COMPUTE): while a
 prompt is read, the expert card computes the experts it holds

Card 1's own experts keep their (fused) path; the expert card gets the rows that path quantizes (f32 rows), channel v7 prefill
regions sized by TOKENS, per-token reduce on the expert card, compute-vs-lend cost model, failure path on card 1, STRATA_D4_CHECK
diagnostic (off).  Unset = the lending path exactly as before.  remote_prefill_test and d4_plan_test run on the CPU.

The include/strata/seabraid/channel.hpp (and expert_spec.hpp) half of this change lives in Seabraid's
adapters/strata/wire, the wire's one owner; this patch keeps only the engine side.
